---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro'; import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro'; import { organization } from '../data/organization';
---
<MainLayout title="Get involved" description="Find ways to connect with Vijayman Unnatdhara Welfare Foundation." eyebrow="Get involved"><section class="section shell intro-grid"><div><SectionHeading title="There is more than one way to show up." /></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Your time, skills and attention can help create room for meaningful social development.</p><p>As the foundation’s public programmes take shape, we welcome thoughtful conversations with people who want to participate, collaborate or understand more.</p><h2>Start a conversation</h2><p>Tell the foundation a little about your interest and the team can share what opportunities are currently confirmed.</p><a class="button" href={`mailto:${organization.email}?subject=Getting%20involved%20with%20Vijayman%20Unnatdhara`}>Email the foundation <span>↗</span></a></div></section><section class="section section-tint"><div class="shell"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Possible paths" title="Bring what you can." /><div class="focus-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Volunteer</h3><p>Offer your time when a confirmed opportunity is available.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Share a skill</h3><p>Explore skills-based support and practical collaboration.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Partner</h3><p>Open a conversation about institutional or community partnership.</p></article></div></div></section></MainLayout>
